{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc601\uc5b4.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010Game Introduction\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 The protagonist ends an ordinary day and falls asleep\u2014<br>Only to awaken in a strange, unfamiliar prison, not their usual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With memories still hazy and a monster in pursuit, death seems inevitable\u2014<br>Until four strangers appear before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is then that the protagonist realizes:<br>This place is the world of an RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the world of \u300aTime in Wonderland\u300b!</i><br><i>You have been chosen as the hero who will save Wonderland from the tyrant, the Heart Queen.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010System Overview\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300eRe.dive Wonderland\u300f is an otome game where two parts alternate:<br>A <strong>pixel-art style mystery adventure and minigame</strong> segment that the player can control directly,<br>and a <strong>visual novel</strong> part rich in story and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices may lead you on a journey toward the truth of the world,<br>or guide you straight into unexpected bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every story is shaped by the choices <strong>you</strong> make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfed \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc2a4\ud300\uc6a9__1_.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist of the story: <strong>Carol</strong><br>(*Name can be changed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;If this is all just a dream... do I even want to wake up?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfee \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc2a4\ud300\uc6a9__4_.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cheerful mood-maker: <strong>Raven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Relax and enjoy it. We've got your back.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfef \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc2a4\ud300\uc6a9__3_.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gentle prince with a warm smile: <strong>Setsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;No matter what you choose, it\u2019s all part of the path to the happiest ending.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udff0 \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc2a4\ud300\uc6a9__5_.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The unpredictable rebel: <strong>Noah</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;So all it takes is saving you to earn your trust? That\u2019s... surprisingly easy.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udff1 \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc2a4\ud300\uc6a9__2_.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enigmatic guide of this otherworld: <strong>Yuri</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Just remember\u2014someone who can help you is always nearby.&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625350?t=1745076686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/7d7c1f15b752dff415217d3f2e3060290a7d4c07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745076686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/dde89ee484f97afbde7c91bd6b20517711a23711/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745076686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/dde89ee484f97afbde7c91bd6b20517711a23711/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745076686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc601\uc5b4.jpg?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1745076686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph